From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Miguel Branco <miguel@raw-labs.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 14:32:03 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(gateway): hot-apply identity membership without
 restarting peers

Keep committed per-identity admission and scope policy for proxy sessions, preserve unrelated connections and signed plugin cookies, and retain structural credential revocation. Cover real enrollment, removal and publication races.

ClawScarf-Patch: membership-hot-reload
